expo-alternate-app-icons 11.0.0 (Android): preserve icon selections when upgrading
from versions that disabled MainActivity. Repair the old component override and
suppress only the new implicit Default alias, on package replacement and module
initialization, without changing explicit icon selections or application data.
Remove when upstream provides an equivalent idempotent upgrade migration.

